{"id": "EUVD-2026-71972", "enisaUuid": "142784b9-c9b9-3f90-b04b-900e7fba9eab", "description": "MindsDB through 26.1.0 contains a server-side request forgery vulnerability in the web crawler handler that allows unauthenticated attackers to fetch arbitrary URLs by supplying caller-controlled URLs to CrawlerTable.list. Attackers can bypass the allowlist control by exploiting the default empty configuration and access internal services and cloud metadata endpoints without authentication.", "datePublished": "2026-09-05T11:01:25", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-24T14:21:13", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/mindsdb/mindshub/issues/12480", "https://github.com/mindsdb/mindshub/blob/v26.1.0/mindsdb/integrations/handlers/web_handler/web_handler.py#L50-L65", "https://github.com/mindsdb/mindshub/blob/v26.1.0/mindsdb/utilities/config.py#L273", "https://github.com/mindsdb/mindshub", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/mindsdb-through-26.1.0-unauthenticated-ssrf-via-web-crawler"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-86173", "GHSA-w6m8-h8j4-89w4"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.65, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "ca139886-7f50-3a03-a047-64f3f02dda0a", "product": {"name": "mindsdb", "vendor": {"name": "n/a"}}, "product_version": "0 \u226426.1.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "738a76a1-5a0a-3fe6-9e76-4908e3d808bc", "vendor": {"name": "mindsdb"}}], "isExploited": false}